# GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) Configuration
#
# To avoid GitHub API rate limits (60 requests/hour unauthenticated vs 5000/hour authenticated),
# you can configure a GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) here.
#
# Get a PAT from: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: 'public_repo' (for public repositories) or 'repo' (for private repositories)
#
# GITHUB_PAT takes precedence over GITHUB_TOKEN

# GITHUB_PAT=ghp_your_token_here
# GITHUB_TOKEN=your_token_here
